    "Reference verification ran locally with Node 22 + vitest against the pinned npm release (@tanstack/table-core@9.1.2, with its @tanstack/store dependency); the Docker-isolated runner pass is pending on the release side.",
    "Dummy gate: an inert stub (no-throw construction, empty row models, no-op setters, empty store/atoms, undefined getters) fails all 137 tests (verified locally); the stub covers both the package root and the store-reactivity-bindings subpath.",
    "Track A is empty by design: all 63 upstream test files import '../../../../src' and/or the internal '../../../../src/static-functions' entry plus tests/fixtures and tests/helpers; zero files import the published package name. The oracle is Track B generated importing only '@tanstack/table-core' and '@tanstack/table-core/store-reactivity-bindings'.",
    "Anti-memorization: v9 (stable 2026-08-07, pinned 9.1.2 released 2026-08-09) is a ground-up rewrite of the memorized v8 API - constructTable+tableFeatures replaces createTable's options object, reactivity requires storeReactivityBindings, row-model factories and fn registries (sortFns/filterFns/aggregationFns) must be registered in the features bag, columnPinning uses start/end instead of left/right, there is no table.getState(). Memory of v8 fails at the first construction call.",
    "Column-definition errors are lazy: a definition that resolves no id (or an accessorFn without an explicit id) causes an Error only when the column tree first materializes (e.g. getAllColumns), not at constructTable time.",
    "getSelectedRowModel() selects over the core row model (selection survives filtering); getFilteredSelectedRowModel() is the intersection with the filtered model. toggleAllRowsSelected(true) under an active filter selects only the filtered rows.",
    "Named fn resolution ('alphanumeric', 'includesString', 'sum', ...) requires the corresponding registry in the features bag; 'auto' aggregation resolves by value type and returns undefined when aggregationFns is not registered, while an unknown sortFn string falls back to the basic sort.",
    "Error assertions check only that an Error is thrown (message wording is not contracted).",
    "2 spec claims corrected from reference execution during Stage 3: (1) the no-resolvable-id error is thrown lazily at column-tree materialization, not at construction; (2) getSelectedRowModel is core-model based and getFilteredSelectedRowModel carries the filtered intersection.",
    "All expected values (row-model outputs, group row ids, colSpan matrices, facet projections, pagination clamps, pinned column partitions) were observed by executing the pinned release (probe scripts tt1-tt10), not inferred from documentation."
